(  - Provide cross-validation means and stds.) Tj
T*
(  - Present per-district error table and visualization (boxplots or bar charts).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Reproducibility:) Tj
T*
(  - Pinned dependencies in requirements.txt.) Tj
T*
(  - Fixed random seeds for model training and CV folds.) Tj
T*
(  - Step-by-step README with instructions to run demo.ipynb in Colab.) Tj
T*
() Tj
